{'symbol': 'INVH', 'date': '2023-03-17 06:45:00', 'title': "INVITATION HOMES RECEIVES CREDIT RATING UPGRADE TO ‘BBB' FROM STANDARD AND POOR'S", 'text': "DALLAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--INVITATION HOMES INC. (NYSE: INVH) (“INVITATION HOMES” OR THE “COMPANY”) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT S&P GLOBAL RATINGS (“S&P”) UPGRADED THE COMPANY'S ISSUER AND ISSUE-LEVEL CREDIT RATINGS TO ‘BBB' FROM ‘BBB-' WITH A STABLE OUTLOOK."}